<%- include('partials/head') %>

<section class="hiw-hero">
  <p class="hiw-step-label">How it works</p>
  <h1>A game you play in real life.<br>Six steps from employee to owner.</h1>
  <p class="lead">NoBossly turns starting a business into ten levels you climb with real accomplishments &mdash; your Compass, your idea, your first sale. The AI advises. The community witnesses. You play.</p>
  <div class="cta-row" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:1.5rem">
    <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/signup">Press start &mdash; it's free &rarr;</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="/pricing">See pricing</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row single" style="margin-top:2rem">
  <div>
    <p class="hiw-step-label">Step 1</p>
    <h2>&#x1F9ED; Roll your character: the Founder Compass</h2>
    <p class="muted">Every game starts with a character sheet. Ours is drawn from you &mdash; a 10-minute questionnaire with three starting paths: no idea yet, an idea but no business, or already running one. Out comes your Founder Compass:</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li><strong>Your archetype</strong> &mdash; a named founder class with how your type wins and where it struggles</li>
      <li><strong>Your loadout</strong> &mdash; strengths, unfair advantages, and your binding constraints, read back honestly</li>
      <li><strong>Territories</strong> &mdash; opportunity zones where your profile gives you a real edge, with live market temperature</li>
      <li><strong>Your 5-point fit test</strong> &mdash; personal pass/fail criteria distilled from your own answers</li>
      <li><strong>The avoid list</strong> &mdash; what looks tempting but conflicts with your constraints</li>
      <li><strong>Starter toolkit</strong> &mdash; real tools matched to your territories, most of them free</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="muted small">Already running a business? Your Compass becomes a diagnostic: strategic directions with honest tradeoffs &mdash; laid out for you to choose from, never verdicts.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row">
  <div>
    <p class="hiw-step-label">Step 2</p>
    <h2>&#x270D;&#xFE0F; Choose your own quest</h2>
    <p class="muted">Here's the twist most platforms get wrong: <strong>you</strong> pick the idea. Draft it in your own words &mdash; then your AI advisor stress-tests it against your own fit test and a live market search.</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li>A <strong>pass/fail read on all 5</strong> of your fit-test criteria</li>
      <li>An honest success probability &mdash; not a motivational number</li>
      <li>Real competitors, real demand signals, real market temperature</li>
      <li>A <strong>sharper wedge</strong> where your loadout gives the strongest edge &mdash; offered, never imposed</li>
      <li>Revise it, overrule it, or lock it in. Your business, your call.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="card" style="align-self:center;padding:1.5rem">
    <span class="tag">Advisor verdict-free readout</span>
    <h3 style="margin:.6rem 0 .25rem">Your idea vs. your fit test</h3>
    <ul class="task-list" style="margin:.6rem 0 0">
      <li class="task done"><button class="task-check">&#x2713;</button><div><strong>Under your $500 budget</strong></div></li>
      <li class="task done"><button class="task-check">&#x2713;</button><div><strong>Sellable in 10 hrs/week</strong></div></li>
      <li class="task done"><button class="task-check">&#x2713;</button><div><strong>No inventory (deal breaker)</strong></div></li>
      <li class="task"><button class="task-check"></button><div><strong>Survives your fear of cold calls</strong> <span class="tag tag-high">strains</span></div></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="muted small" style="margin:.7rem 0 0">&#x1F4A1; Sharper wedge: narrow to warm-referral clients first.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row single">
  <div>
    <p class="hiw-step-label">Step 3</p>
    <h2>&#x1F4D0; Get your battle plan</h2>
    <p class="muted">Lock in your idea and NoBossly generates its launch blueprint &mdash; not a template with blanks, a real strategy document written for your specific business.</p>
    <div class="grid" style="margin-top:1rem">
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Positioning &amp; pitch</h4>
        <p class="muted small">A ready-to-use positioning statement, elevator pitch, and the differentiators that separate you from competitors.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Ideal customer profile</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Your ICP archetype, demographics, pain points, and exactly where to find them &mdash; specific forums, communities, and platforms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Revenue model &amp; pricing</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Recommended revenue type with rationale, plus tiered pricing with what each tier includes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Revenue projections</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Month 3, Month 6, and Month 12 revenue targets so you know what you&rsquo;re building toward.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Go-to-market strategy</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Specific channels with effort ratings, how to land your first paying customer, and a week-one action checklist.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Roadmap summary</h4>
        <p class="muted small">How your business scales from launch through growth &mdash; plus your first tasks auto-added to your board.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted small" style="margin-top:1rem">Launch blueprints are a paid feature. The Compass, drafting your idea, and the advisor are free.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row">
  <div>
    <p class="hiw-step-label">Step 4</p>
    <h2>&#x1F3C3; Sprint between rungs</h2>
    <p class="muted">The blueprint doesn&rsquo;t sit in a drawer. NoBossly turns it into 7-day sprints &mdash; focused blocks of work that move you from one rung of the Ladder to the next.</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li>Sprint auto-populated with <strong>prioritised tasks</strong> from your blueprint&rsquo;s week-one actions</li>
      <li>Full <strong>kanban task board</strong> with deadlines and email reminders</li>
      <li><strong>Daily check-in</strong> earns +15 XP and extends your streak (one freeze per month &mdash; a busy Tuesday won&rsquo;t reset you)</li>
      <li><strong>Sprint velocity</strong> shows what percentage of tasks you completed</li>
      <li>When one sprint ends, start the next &mdash; each building on the last</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="card" style="padding:1.5rem;align-self:center">
    <h4 style="margin:0 0 .4rem">&#x1F4CB; Sample sprint</h4>
    <p class="muted small" style="margin:0 0 1rem">Theme: Landing page &amp; first lead &middot; 4 of 7 tasks done</p>
    <div class="progress" style="margin-bottom:1rem"><div class="progress-bar" style="width:57%"></div></div>
    <ul class="task-list" style="margin:0">
      <li class="task done"><button class="task-check">&#x2713;</button><div><strong>Register domain name</strong> <span class="tag tag-high">high</span></div></li>
      <li class="task done"><button class="task-check">&#x2713;</button><div><strong>Write the hero headline</strong> <span class="tag tag-high">high</span></div></li>
      <li class="task"><button class="task-check"></button><div><strong>Set up email capture form</strong> <span class="tag tag-medium">medium</span></div></li>
      <li class="task"><button class="task-check"></button><div><strong>Post in 3 relevant communities</strong> <span class="tag tag-medium">medium</span></div></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row single">
  <div>
    <p class="hiw-step-label">Step 5</p>
    <h2>&#x1F3AE; Climb the Founder&rsquo;s Ladder</h2>
    <p class="muted">Ten levels, and here&rsquo;s what makes it a real game: <strong>XP alone can never buy a rung.</strong> Every level gates on a genuine accomplishment &mdash; a quest completed in the real world. XP and streaks pace you between rungs; the achievements move you up them.</p>
    <div class="grid" style="margin-top:1rem">
      <div class="card">
        <h4>&#x1F50D; Level 2 &mdash; Explorer</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Blueprint built, idea validated, and 3 real humans gave you feedback. You&rsquo;ve committed to a direction.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>&#x1F528; Level 3 &mdash; Builder</h4>
        <p class="muted small">You shipped something into the world and completed your first sprint. It&rsquo;s real now.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>&#x2699;&#xFE0F; Level 5 &mdash; Operator</h4>
        <p class="muted small"><strong>First sale.</strong> A registered business and a real customer paying real money. The level the whole game aims at.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>&#x1F3AF; Level 8 &mdash; Launcher</h4>
        <p class="muted small">A $1k month and a pitch deck. This rung unlocks the accelerator track &mdash; you&rsquo;re program-ready.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>&#x1F451; Level 10 &mdash; Legend</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Sustained revenue and your playbook documented and published for the founders climbing behind you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>&#x26A1; XP, streaks &amp; badges</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Every task, check-in, and challenge earns XP. Level-defining quests post to the public Wins wall &mdash; witnessed, not just claimed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted small" style="margin-top:1rem">In an accelerator program? The Ladder runs alongside it &mdash; levels 4 through 8 mirror the customer-discovery-to-pitch curriculum, and completing a program counts toward Level 9.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row">
  <div>
    <p class="hiw-step-label">Step 6</p>
    <h2>&#x1F310; Play multiplayer</h2>
    <p class="muted">Quests are harder alone. NoBossly is built to be played with witnesses &mdash; founders at every rung, keeping score in public.</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li><strong>Cohort challenges</strong> &mdash; one start date, one deadline, one leaderboard</li>
      <li><strong>The Wins wall</strong> &mdash; first dollars, first customers, resignation letters, witnessed</li>
      <li><strong>Forum</strong> &mdash; post questions, get feedback on your idea or copy between rungs</li>
      <li><strong>Member directory &amp; DMs</strong> &mdash; find founders by level, connect directly</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="card" style="padding:1.5rem;align-self:center">
    <h4 style="margin:0 0 1rem">Your public profile</h4>
    <div class="profile-head" style="align-items:center;margin-bottom:1rem">
      <div class="avatar-circle">D</div>
      <div>
        <strong>Dillon Price</strong>
        <p class="muted small" style="margin:.2rem 0 0">&#x1F528; Level 3 &mdash; Builder &middot; &#x26A1; 325 XP</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin-bottom:.75rem">
      <span class="chip">&#x1F3C5; Shipped Something</span>
      <span class="chip">&#x1F3C5; Sprint 1 Complete</span>
      <span class="chip chip-success">&#x2705; Climbing to Operator</span>
    </div>
    <p class="muted small" style="margin:0">Bootstrapping a geo-flexible job board. &#x1F525; 12-day streak.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="margin:3rem 0">
  <h2 style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:.5rem">Free to play. Upgrade to climb faster.</h2>
  <p class="muted" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:2rem">No credit card needed to start. Upgrade any time from your account settings.</p>
  <div class="pricing-grid">
    <div class="card price-card">
      <h3>Free</h3>
      <p class="price">$0<span class="muted small"> forever</span></p>
      <ul class="feature-list">
        <li>&#10003; Founder Compass &mdash; archetype, territories &amp; fit test</li>
        <li>&#10003; Draft your idea + advisor stress-test</li>
        <li>&#10003; Community forum &amp; Wins wall</li>
        <li>&#10003; Streaks, XP &amp; the Founder&rsquo;s Ladder</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-block" href="/signup">Press start free</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card price-card price-featured">
      <span class="chip chip-success">Full access</span>
      <h3>Paid plans</h3>
      <p class="price">From <strong>$12</strong><span class="muted small">/month</span></p>
      <ul class="feature-list">
        <li>&#10003; Everything in Free</li>
        <li>&#10003; Launch blueprints for your chosen idea</li>
        <li>&#10003; AI-planned 7-day sprints &amp; roadmaps</li>
        <li>&#10003; Live demand signals with named sources</li>
        <li>&#10003; AI-tailored challenges &amp; milestones</li>
        <li>&#10003; Badges &amp; community shout-outs</li>
        <li>&#10003; Budget tracker</li>
        <li>&#10003; Priority support</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn-primary btn-block" href="/pricing">See all plans</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band">
  <h2>Your boss isn&rsquo;t going to fire themselves.</h2>
  <p class="muted">Join free, draw your Founder Compass in about 10 minutes, and start the climb. Level 5 is a real customer paying you real money.</p>
  <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" style="margin-top:1.1rem;display:inline-block" href="/signup">Draw my Founder Compass &rarr;</a>
</section>

